#==============================================================================================
#
#   font_computer_1 - CSS::FontComputer's keys and CSS::FontLoader: loading an @font-face
#                     rule's URL sources one after the other
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/FontComputer.cpp (lines 1-297) and the inline members of
#       FontComputer.h (lines 24-98): FontWeightRange, FontFaceKey and ComputedFontCacheKey
#       with their AK::Traits (the hashes generated/types_traits calls), FontLoader (fetching
#       a font, the WOFF2 preparation and its subscribers), font_width_bucket_from_percentage
#       and MatchingFontCandidate. Fetching is phase 2: fetch_a_style_resource reaches the
#       Fetch stubs.
